This folder will contain the built files.

It must exist as a directory even when empty -- KROME's own prerequisite
check (get_file_list() in kromelib.py) requires "build" to be present and
will block with an interactive prompt (which fails non-interactively,
e.g. in a SLURM job) if it's missing. Since git doesn't track empty
directories, this file exists to keep the directory itself present in a
fresh checkout. Do not delete it without replacing it with something else
that keeps this directory tracked.
